Z||000002||artherd||08-06-2001||06:31 AM||||I routinely get waved and 'thubms-uped" by passing motorists or pedestrians, it's great fun :)<P>People always asking "what kind of Ferrari is that" or "those exotic cars are so cool" and such.  Heh.<P>We have a truely remarkable and exotic (even if mass-produced) car, a real cultural rule-breaker in that respect.<P>And let's face it, just plain fun to drive!<P>Best!<BR>Ben<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||1
