Z||000010||Elvira||08-11-2001||09:07 AM||||Chester and I went down to Hampton Beach which, in the winter takes you about 5 minutes to get from one end to the other, but in the summer can take over an hour.  We had a couple of kids (late teens/early 20s) ask us if our car is a rebody.  Chester told them "No, it's a Fiero GT" and they were totally amazed.  They told is it was one of the sweetest rides they had seen.  Makes you feel good.  Makes our kids feel good too as we were down there to bring our 16 year old son his keys.  Whenever he sees us coming and there is a crowd of people, he gets the biggest sh*t-eating grin on his face!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> Good thing he can't drive a stick yet! <BR><P>------------------<BR>Elvira<BR>Blue 87GT<BR>Black 86GT 5sp x 2<BR>86SC t-top 58k miles||||reg||1
